      ["Combined strong CYP3A4 and P-gp inhibitors (ketoconazole, itraconazole, ritonavir - reduce apixaban to 2.5 mg BID, or avoid if already on 2.5 mg)", "Combined strong CYP3A4 and P-gp inducers (rifampin, carbamazepine, St. John's wort - avoid combination)", "Aspirin, NSAIDs, antiplatelets (additive major bleeding risk)"],
