      ["Activated Clotting Time (ACT) during PCI (target ACT 225 to 320 seconds)", "Renal function (serum creatinine / eGFR) to adjust continuous infusion rate", "Hemoglobin, hematocrit, and femoral puncture site for hematoma"],
      "Category B; limited human pregnancy data; use only if potential benefit justifies potential risk.",
